<body>
  <div class="app">
<%- include('../partials/sidebar', { activePage: 'community-service' }) %>
    <main class="main">
<%- include('../partials/topbar', { student }) %>


      <section class="voice-header">
        <h1>Community Service</h1>
        <p>What is the need in our community, and how can we help?</p>
      </section>

      <div class="cs-notice">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 8V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="16.2" r="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        <span>This graduation requirement and the clubs/opportunities below are for <strong>high school students (Grades 9–12)</strong> only.</span>
      </div>

      <section class="cs-intro">
        <p>
          Community service is a contribution of a student's time in volunteer activities that serve a local,
          regional, national, or global community in a meaningful way. You're encouraged to find opportunities
          you're genuinely passionate about — through direct action (with), indirect action (for), or advocacy
          (about).
        </p>
        <p>
          Use the <a href="https://www.un.org/sustainabledevelopment/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UN Sustainable Development Goals</a>
          as a guide to understand an issue, collaborate with relevant participants, and contribute to your community.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="ipar-section">
        <h2 class="section-heading">The Process</h2>
        <div class="ipar-grid">
          <div class="ipar-step">
            <span class="ipar-number">1</span>
            <h3>Investigate</h3>
            <p>Identify a need in your community and research the issue.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ipar-step">
            <span class="ipar-number">2</span>
            <h3>Plan</h3>
            <p>Design a project or find an organization that addresses that need.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ipar-step">
            <span class="ipar-number">3</span>
            <h3>Act</h3>
            <p>Carry out your service project or volunteer work.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ipar-step">
            <span class="ipar-number">4</span>
            <h3>Reflect</h3>
            <p>Reflect on the impact of your service and what you learned.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cs-resources">
        <h2 class="section-heading">Resources</h2>
        <div class="resource-list">
          <a class="resource-link" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RPMj-o6DTyChbQo3NS_cy1ap-ux9FNws/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span>Community Service Graduation Requirement</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H9M17 7V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="resource-link" href="https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ngQhffVHjNJEwxqflLvJFHYbAnNwHgMUcTil5ItpVjk/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span>Process Slides Summary</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H9M17 7V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="resource-link" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1g2i9S0nWOXvtIZdQy22v6b3N-eokPe49mBfWUNXdkRk/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span>Proposal Form Template</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H9M17 7V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="resource-link" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jVvXJ2AypF27KLk3fcAaf8EkrO9eCSprBaeduGbWeS4/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <span>Project Report Template</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 17L17 7M17 7H9M17 7V15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="resource-link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfIrDAQIR-Eeu-oERg4Qo6DSINCOdzxzqR6uZ8y33b2Mk9Vhw/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
